# Clovifi - Firebase Authentication Configuration
# ----------------------------------------------------
# 1. Create a Firebase project at: https://console.firebase.google.com/
# 2. Add a Web App ("</>") under Project Settings -> General.
# 3. Enable "Email/Password" and "Google" in Authentication -> Sign-in method.
# 4. Copy and paste the configuration keys below into a .env file (or provide them in chat):

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSyYourProjectApiKeyHere
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your-project-id.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your-project-id.appspot.com
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=123456789012
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:123456789012:web:abcdef123456
